# SolarAudit

**Solar Energy Audit & Engineering Platform**

SolarAudit is an engineering-first platform for solar power auditing and system sizing. It turns site and load information into structured electrical calculations, equipment selections, project records, and reproducible engineering reports.

The platform is built on a strict separation of concerns:

```text
User Interface
      │
      ▼
Application Services
      │
      ▼
Engineering Calculation Engine
      │
      ▼
Validation / Rules
      │
      ▼
Persistence
      │
      ▼
Reports / Audit Results
```

The engineering engine has **no dependency on the UI or the database**, so calculations can be tested in isolation, reused across clients, and executed from multiple APIs.

