## 17. Frontend Architecture

The frontend follows a feature-oriented structure.

```text
src/
├── features/
│   ├── dashboard/
│   ├── load-audit/
│   ├── solar-sizing/
│   ├── battery-sizing/
│   ├── inverter-sizing/
│   ├── cable-sizing/
│   ├── protection/
│   └── reports/
│
├── services/
├── components/
├── repositories/
├── types/
├── utils/
└── app/
```

Feature modules **must not embed engineering formulas** inside UI components. They call services; services call engines.

---

## 18. Engineering / UI Separation

```text
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│           UI                │
│ React / Vite                │
└──────────────┬──────────────┘
               │
               ▼
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│ Application Services        │
│ Request / response mapping  │
└──────────────┬──────────────┘
               │
               ▼
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│ Engineering Engine          │
│ Pure calculations           │
└──────────────┬──────────────┘
               │
      ┌────────┴────────┐
      ▼                 ▼
 Validation          Constants
      │                 │
      └────────┬────────┘
               ▼
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│ Persistence                 │
│ D1 / SQLite / repositories  │
└─────────────────────────────┘
```

This makes engineering calculations testable without the browser or the database.

---

## 19. Backend Architecture

The production backend runs on Cloudflare Workers.

```text
                 Internet
                    │
                    ▼
             Cloudflare Worker
                    │
       ┌────────────┼────────────┐
       │            │            │
       ▼            ▼            ▼
     Load         Solar        Battery
     API           API           API
       │            │            │
       └────────────┼────────────┘
                    │
                    ▼
             Engineering Core
                    │
                    ▼
                   D1
```

**Cloudflare services used as needed:**

| Service | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Workers | API + edge compute |
| D1 | Structured application data |
| R2 | Generated documents, large objects |
| KV | Config, feature flags |
| Queues | Background jobs |
| Pages | Frontend hosting |

