## 25. Testing Strategy

```text
Unit Tests
    │
    ▼
Engineering Engine Tests
    │
    ▼
Service Tests
    │
    ▼
API Tests
    │
    ▼
Integration Tests
    │
    ▼
UI Tests
```

Engineering calculations receive **extensive** unit coverage — errors here propagate into real electrical systems.

