## 27. Development Workflow

Every new engineering capability follows the same path:

```text
Define Requirement
       │
       ▼
Define Input Schema
       │
       ▼
Implement Calculation
       │
       ▼
Add Validation
       │
       ▼
Write Tests
       │
       ▼
Expose Service/API
       │
       ▼
Connect UI
       │
       ▼
Persist Result
       │
       ▼
Generate Report
```

**Rule:** a new capability is never implemented directly inside a page component.

---

## 28. Implementation Sequence

Order follows the dependency chain from load data to full system design:

```text
01. Load Engine
02. Energy Engine
03. Solar Engine
04. Battery Engine
05. Inverter Engine
06. Cable Engine
07. Voltage-Drop Engine
08. Charge-Controller Engine
09. Protection Engine
10. BOM Engine
11. Costing Engine
12. Reporting Engine
```

