## 30. Engineering Principle

SolarAudit is not a load calculator with a UI on top. It is an **engineering decision and audit platform**.

```text
FIELD DATA
    │
    ▼
ENGINEERING INPUTS
    │
    ▼
CALCULATIONS
    │
    ▼
VALIDATION
    │
    ▼
EQUIPMENT SELECTION
    │
    ▼
BOM / COST
    │
    ▼
ENGINEERING REPORT
```

Every recommendation is explainable from the underlying input data, assumptions, equations, component ratings, and validation rules.

---

## 31. Project Status

SolarAudit is under active development.

**Current priorities:**

```text
Load Audit
Engineering Calculation Engines
Dashboard
API Architecture
Cloudflare Worker Backend
D1 Persistence
Engineering Validation
Reporting
```

The engineering calculation layer remains the core of the platform. The frontend, API, database, and reporting systems are built **around** it — never the other way around.

